  "_note": "EXP-42 arm B: corroborative (cooperative) verifier over the eight D47 held-out countries at full 143. Prereg docs/EXPERIMENTS_EXP42_STANCE_HELDOUT.md. Comparator arm A is a zero-cost decision-layer replay off exp36_frozen_headline, not dispatched. Eight per-country arms are REQUIRED, not cosmetic: exp36 stored condition_label as the country code, and the attempt-1 seed predicate pins a single scalar label, so one combined arm would match zero seed rows and silently run everything live. Expected seed hits total 392 (per-country in _expected_seed_hits); a dispatch whose seed count differs is a failed dispatch, not a result. Requires verifier-corroborate V3 (V2 plus the corroboration mirror of the dropped staleness criterion) before dispatch. Order is stratum B first with SE last: dataportal.se SPARQL has hung dispatch in rdflib for ~90 min with no per-arm timeout, so it needs a stall watchdog. budget_calls 60000: 1144 pairs x 45 worst-case CALLS_PER_PAIR = 51,480, plus headroom.",
